Specification Common Types 

DomainTerm AccountID : StandardID 
 
Entity Account
Description Represents a bank account held by a customer.
Details \
  Each account has a type, a current balance, and a unique ID. 
| Attribute | Type        | Default  | Notes            |
| Type      | AccountType | Checking |                  |
| Balance   | Dollar      | 0        | Must be >= 0     |
| AccountID | StandardID  | (none)   | Must be provided |

DataType StandardID
Description  Used to identify accounts and other items
Details Must be three digits, dash, three digits  
Examples: ValidValues
| Value   | IsValid | Notes |
| 123-456 | Yes   |       |
| 123-45  | No    |       |
| -1      | No    |       |



